## 3. Architecture

### Final architecture diagram
[Paste link hoặc embed ảnh diagram sau khi Minh commit]

### Service mapping — 7 mandatory capabilities
| # | Capability | Service | Why |
|---|-----------|---------|-----|
| 1 | User-Facing Entry | CloudFront + S3 static + API Gateway HTTP API | Public HTTPS, low ops overhead |
| 2 | Application Compute | Lambda Python + FastAPI + Mangum | Serverless, cheap, fast deploy |
| 3 | AI/ML Feature | Bedrock Knowledge Base + Claude Haiku + Titan Embeddings | RAG grounds answers in uploaded docs |
| 4 | Data Persistence | DynamoDB | Topic/session metadata is key-value, no JOIN needed |
| 5 | Object Storage | S3 | Stores uploaded files + static frontend |
| 6 | Network Foundation | VPC + private subnets + Security Groups | DB not public, resource access controlled |
| 7 | Identity & Access | IAM least-privilege execution roles | No wildcard policies |

### Optional capability attempted
- #8 Full Observability — CloudWatch dashboard + custom metric + alarm + Log Insights query

